ONNX Runtime
============

Project: ONNX Runtime, https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

The Linux packages load a local ONNX Runtime shared library at runtime. Android
packages use the official ONNX Runtime Android AAR. HarmonyOS uses a pinned
community OpenHarmony ARM64 build from
https://github.com/csukuangfj/onnxruntime-libs/releases/tag/v1.26.0 (version
1.26.0-ohos), verified by byte count and SHA-256 before packaging. That build is
an unmodified redistribution of ONNX Runtime for the OpenHarmony target and
remains under this MIT license. The Android/Linux libraries are not reused for
HarmonyOS. The model format and the runtime are separate works; the model
license is recorded in third_party/macbert4csc/NOTICE.
